# CP2K twin sketch for regressions/dynamics/cpmd-thermostat-kpoints (offline
# oracle — never run at ctest/regression time). Periodic H2 Quickstep RKS MD
# with KPOINTS + fictitious electronic DOF (CP) + an electronic Nose-Hoover
# thermostat on the fictitious orbital velocities. Twin of ATV: DZV-GTH-PADE,
# PADE XC, mesh 1x1x2, compressed bond, short NVE nuclei, mu = 400 a.u.,
# K0 = 1e-5 Ha, tau_e = 50 fs.
#
# NOTE (2026-07-31): UNEXECUTABLE SKETCH — family oracle lock. CP2K 2026.1
# (present on this host) has no fictitious-mass Car-Parrinello propagator
# (QS is BO-only: diagonalization/OT + ASPC extrapolation), so neither the CP
# extended conserved quantity E_ext = E_KS + T_n + T_e + E_therm nor the
# electronic-thermostat energy is a number it can print. Same lock as
# cpmd_electronic_thermostat_h2o.inp / cpmd-kpoints/h2_cpmd_kpoints_nve.inp.
# The BO surface underneath is CP2K-anchored via gpw-kpoints-si /
# gpw-kpoint-forces / gpw-bomd-kpoints. Pin = literature envelope
# (Blochl & Parrinello PRB 45, 9413 (1992); Marx & Hutter, CUP 2009).
&GLOBAL
  PROJECT h2_cpmd_thermostat_kpoints_nve
  RUN_TYPE MD
  PRINT_LEVEL LOW
&END GLOBAL
&MOTION
  &MD
    ENSEMBLE NVE          # nuclei NVE; ONLY the electronic DOF thermostatted
    STEPS 6
    TIMESTEP 0.1
    TEMPERATURE 10.0
  &END MD
&END MOTION
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD Quickstep
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_MOLOPT
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME GTH_POTENTIALS
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 100
      REL_CUTOFF 40
      NGRIDS 4
    &END MGRID
    &QS
      METHOD GPW
      EPS_DEFAULT 1.0E-10
      # No CP2K keyword exists for fictitious-mass CP with an electronic
      # Nose-Hoover (mu = 400 a.u., K0 = 1e-5 Ha, tau_e = 50 fs per sampled
      # k channel) — this block documents the intended twin only.
      EXTRAPOLATION ASPC
      EXTRAPOLATION_ORDER 3
    &END QS
    &SCF
      SCF_GUESS ATOMIC
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-5
      MAX_SCF 60
      &DIAGONALIZATION
        ALGORITHM STANDARD
      &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &MIXING
        METHOD DIRECT_P_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.3
      &END MIXING
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PADE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
    &KPOINTS
      SCHEME MONKHORST-PACK 1 1 2
      FULL_GRID .TRUE.
    &END KPOINTS
    &POISSON
      PERIODIC XYZ
      PSOLVER PERIODIC
    &END POISSON
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
      ABC 6.350145 6.350145 6.350145
      PERIODIC XYZ
    &END CELL
    &COORD
      H  2.9105  3.1751  3.1751
      H  3.4396  3.1751  3.1751
    &END COORD
    &KIND H
      BASIS_SET DZV-GTH-PADE
      POTENTIAL GTH-PADE-q1
    &END KIND
    &VELOCITY
      H -0.0010  0.0000  0.0000
      H  0.0010  0.0000  0.0000
    &END VELOCITY
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
